Source: gix
Section: vcs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Krysztal Huang <krysztal.huang@outlook.com>
Build-Depends:
 {{RUST_PACKAGE_NAME}} (= {{RUST_PACKAGE_VERSION}}),
 cmake,
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: {{SOURCE_GIT}}
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: gix
Architecture: any
Depends: ca-certificates, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: fast, safe, pure-Rust git implementation (command-line interface)
 gix is the command-line interface of gitoxide, an implementation of git
 written in pure Rust. It provides familiar git porcelain commands along
 with plumbing tools for repository inspection, built for speed, safety,
 and a friendly user experience.
